@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 210
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 75
hide circle
hide empty members
package "实际退款、未知核实及失败重办" as T {
' @reference fee_request
class "费用申请" as request_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_payment
class "患者付款" as payment_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_funds
class "患者资金" as funds_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_refund
class "退款办理" as previous_refund_t <<entity>>
class "退款办理" as patient_refund <<entity>> {
 唯一退款号、原渠道、接收方核实
 拟退额、实际额、办理时间
 待办理／待核实／已确认退款／已失败
 核实人、时间、凭据及失败依据
 --
 +核对批准额度及原款可用额()
 +建立办理并占用额度()
 +保留未知结果与占用()
 +确认实际退款(真实金额与凭据)
 +确认失败并释放占用(依据)
 +关联失败原单重办()
}
request_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
payment_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
funds_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
previous_refund_t "原失败单\n0..1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
request_t -[hidden]right- payment_t
payment_t -[hidden]right- funds_t
note bottom of patient_refund
拟退不超批准剩余额及原款可用额。
待办／未知占用拟退额；失败释放，成功扣实际额。
0＜实际额≤拟退额，部分成功重核剩余额。
查原笔后补记，不能因未知重发；医保款不退作现金。
end note
}
@enduml
